<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Viking Office raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Viking Office raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lazard Freres said it upgraded Viking Office Products Inc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 3/4 to 28-3/8.</p>
</text>
